---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services
description: Arboricultural consulting services including health assessments, aerial inspections, hazard assessment, DA support, root mapping and tree advice.
permalink: /services/
heroImage: /assets/images/hero-bg.jpg
---

<section class="hero hero--short">
  <div class="hero__bg">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/hero-bg.jpg"
      alt="Tree canopy in the Blue Mountains"
      width="1600"
      height="900"
      loading="eager"
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="high"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="hero__overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <span class="hero__eyebrow">What We Do</span>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Our Services</h1>
    <p class="hero__desc">Qualified arboricultural consulting for the Blue Mountains and greater Western Sydney.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-header__eyebrow">Arboricultural Consulting</span>
      <h2 class="section-header__title">How We Can Help</h2>
      <p class="section-header__desc">From health assessments to DA reports and independent tree advice - Mike provides qualified, practical guidance you can trust.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for service in site.services %}
        <a href="{{ service.url }}" class="card" data-reveal>
          <img
            src="{{ service.image }}"
            alt="{{ service.name }}"
            class="card__image"
            width="800"
            height="500"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          >
          <div class="card__body">
            <h3 class="card__title">{{ service.name }}</h3>
            <p class="card__text">{{ service.excerpt }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== NEIGHBOUR DISPUTES ===== #}
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container container--narrow text-center" data-reveal>
    <h2>Neighbour Tree Disputes?</h2>
    <p class="mt-md">Tree disagreements between neighbours can be stressful. Mike provides independent, qualified assessments that help both parties understand the situation clearly. Whether it's overhanging branches, root damage, or safety concerns - an expert opinion can go a long way toward a fair resolution.</p>
    <p class="mt-lg">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Talk to Mike</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== SERVICE AREAS ===== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-header__eyebrow">Where We Work</span>
      <h2 class="section-header__title">Service Areas</h2>
      <p class="section-header__desc">Mike is a Blue Mountains local, based in Medlow Bath. Services extend across the greater Western Sydney region.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center" data-reveal>
      <details class="service-areas-dropdown">
        <summary class="btn btn--secondary">View All Service Areas</summary>
        <div class="service-areas-list mt-lg">
          <div class="grid grid--3">
            {% for area in site.serviceAreas %}
              <div class="text-center">
                <p class="font-semibold">{{ area }}</p>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <p class="mt-lg text-muted text-center">Not sure if we cover your area? Give Mike a call - he may still be able to help.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
